    "faqItems": {
      "q1": "How do I get started with Hoot?",
      "a1": "To get started with Hoot, simply create an account, complete verification, then connect your exchange API. Our getting started guide will walk you through each step. You can add exchange API Keys on the Wallet page to connect your trading account.",
      "q2": "Which exchanges does Hoot support?",
      "a2": "Hoot supports major cryptocurrency exchanges including Binance, OKX, Bybit, Gate.io, Coinbase, etc. We continuously expand our supported exchange list. You can view the complete list on the Wallet > Exchanges page.",
      "q3": "How do I set up exchange API Keys?",
      "a3": "Go to your exchange account settings and create a new API Key. Make sure to only enable Trading and Read permissions, do not enable Withdrawal permission for fund safety. Then add your API Key on Hoot's Wallet > Exchanges page.",
      "q4": "What are Hoot's trading fees?",
      "a4": "Hoot uses a profit-sharing model. Basic tier Gas Fee is 22% of profits, Advanced is 18%, Professional is 15%. Fees are only charged when strategies are profitable, no fees for losses.",
      "q5": "How is my money kept safe?",
      "a5": "Your funds are always stored in your own exchange account. Hoot never custodies user funds. We only execute trading instructions via API. We recommend enabling 2FA and not granting withdrawal permission to API Keys.",
      "q6": "How are strategy signals executed?",
      "a6": "When a strategy generates a trading signal, the system automatically executes trades through your connected exchange API. You can set per-trade amount limits and risk parameters in strategy settings to ensure trades match your risk preferences.",
      "q7": "How do I subscribe to membership?",
      "a7": "Go to My Profile > Membership Subscription page and choose your membership tier. You can pay with USDT or HOOT tokens. Using HOOT tokens for payment gives you extra discounts.",
      "q8": "How do I get help with issues?",
      "a8": "You can contact support via email or live chat at the bottom of the page. Our support team will respond within 24 hours. For urgent issues, we recommend using live chat for immediate assistance."
    }
